{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"text\": \"为难时，那种不必防备的亲近又回到心里，他一认出来，心也软了。\",\n      \"key\": \"不必防备的亲近\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他记得那种亲近曾让自己真心满足，便愿意再多待一会儿。\",\n      \"key\": \"多待一会儿\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他终于松了口气，能安静一会儿，也知道那些难题很快又会回来。\",\n      \"key\": \"安静一会儿\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R40\", \"R41\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S08-1\", \"S08-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把柔软回返与舍不得推开分开，前者交代熟悉感如何回来，后者说明他为什么愿意多停留一会儿。把反问式自我劝说改成记得真实满足、因此愿意享受片刻的具体心思。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R42\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S08-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留短暂喘息、暂时安静和知道安静不会持久的意思。把空泛的暂缓思考改成他知道眼前难题还会回来，也让这次喘息与真正安顿下来有所区别。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e3d7a229-a725-4ad2-998e-c994840e4c80", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T232532343968Z", "elapsed_seconds": 102.359, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T23:27:14.715430+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false